tion_FullSupport\"] == true) == false", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [20], "isPlayer": false, "isRoot": 0}, {"id": 19, "actorId": 70, "speaker": "Laurento Esquibel", "title": "Laurento Esquibel: \"\"Queen Beatrice made a personal app...\"", "dialogueText": "\"Queen Beatrice made a personal appearance at the AN to plead our case.\"", "menuText": "", "conditions": "", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [21], "isPlayer": false, "isRoot": 0}, {"id": 20, "actorId": 70, "speaker": "Laurento Esquibel", "title": "Laurento Esquibel: \"\"Queen Beatrice sent a statement of...\"", "dialogueText": "\"Queen Beatrice sent a statement of support, though she neglected to appear before the arbitration committee in person.\"", "menuText": "", "conditions": "", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [21], "isPlayer": false, "isRoot": 0}, {"id": 21, "actorId": 70, "speaker": "Laurento Esquibel", "title": "Laurento Esquibel: \"\"Chancellor Hegel of Valgsland made...\"", "dialogueText": "\"Chancellor Hegel of Valgsland made an especially heartfelt plea to uphold the original interpretation of ANDOR, without mentioning Rizia by name.\"", "menuText": "", "conditions": "", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [22], "isPlayer": false, "isRoot": 0}, {"id": 22, "actorId": 2, "speaker": "Paskal Beniwoll", "title": "RiziaDLC.MITZ_ScrewedOverLespia == false && RiziaDLC.Turn05_ITZVote_Nationalization == false", "dialogueText": "", "menuText": "", "conditions": "", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [23, 24], "isPlayer": false, "isRoot": 0}, {"id": 23, "actorId": 2, "speaker": "Paskal Beniwoll", "title": "RiziaDLC.MITZ_ScrewedOverLespia == false && RiziaDLC.Turn05_ITZVote_Nationalization == false", "dialogueText": "", "menuText": "", "conditions": "Variable[\"RiziaDLC.MITZ_ScrewedOverLespia\"] == false  and  Variable[\"RiziaDLC.Turn05_ITZVote_Nationalization\"] == false", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [25], "isPlayer": false, "isRoot": 0}, {"id": 24, "actorId": 2, "speaker": "Paskal Beniwoll", "title": "!(RiziaDLC.MITZ_ScrewedOverLespia == false && RiziaDLC.Turn05_ITZVote_Nationalization == false)", "dialogueText": "", "menuText": "", "conditions": "(Variable[\"RiziaDLC.MITZ_ScrewedOverLespia\"] == false  and  Variable[\"RiziaDLC.Turn05_ITZVote_Nationalization\"] == false) == false", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [26], "isPlayer": false, "isRoot": 0}, {"id": 25, "actorId": 70, "speaker": "Laurento Esquibel", "title": "Laurento Esquibel: \"\"Support for Pales came mostly from...\"", "dialogueText": "\"Support for Pales came mostly from Lespia and other ATO nations. Prime Minister Alvarez was not as vocal as he could have been, perhaps due to our alignment in MITZ matters.\"", "menuText": "", "conditions": "", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [28], "isPlayer": false, "isRoot": 0}, {"id": 26, "actorId": 70, "speaker": "Laurento Esquibel", "title": "Laurento Esquibel: \"\"Support for Pales came mostly from...\"", "dialogueText": "\"Support for Pales came mostly from Lespia and other ATO nations, of course.\"", "menuText": "", "conditions": "", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [28], "isPlayer": false, "isRoot": 0}, {"id": 27, "actorId": 70, "speaker": "Laurento Esquibel", "title": "Laurento Esquibel: \"\"Overall, we gained just enough int...\"", "dialogueText": "\"Overall, we gained just enough international sympathy to overcome ATO's clout with the AN and have an edge in the proceedings.\"", "menuText": "", "conditions": "", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [2], "isPlayer": false, "isRoot": 0}, {"id": 28, "actorId": 2, "speaker": "Paskal Beniwoll", "title": "RiziaDLC.Diplomacy_Pales_DiplomaticArbitration_WonHalf == true", "dialogueText": "", "menuText": "", "conditions": "", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [29, 30], "isPlayer": false, "isRoot": 0}, {"id": 29, "actorId": 2, "speaker": "Paskal Beniwoll", "title": "RiziaDLC.Diplomacy_Pales_DiplomaticArbitration_WonHalf == true", "dialogueText": "", "menuText": "", "conditions": "Variable[\"RiziaDLC.Diplomacy_Pales_DiplomaticArbitration_WonHalf\"] == true", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [27], "isPlayer": false, "isRoot": 0}, {"id": 30, "actorId": 2, "speaker": "Paskal Beniwoll", "title": "!(RiziaDLC.Diplomacy_Pales_DiplomaticArbitration_WonHalf == true)", "dialogueText": "", "menuText": "", "conditions": "(Variable[\"RiziaDLC.Diplomacy_Pales_DiplomaticArbitration_WonHalf\"] == true) == false", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [31], "isPlayer": false, "isRoot": 0}, {"id": 31, "actorId": 70, "speaker": "Laurento Esquibel", "title": "Laurento Esquibel: \"\"In the end, we simply couldn't ove...\"", "dialogueText": "\"In the end, we simply couldn't overcome the clout ATO carries with the AN.\"", "menuText": "", "conditions": "", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [2], "isPlayer": false, "isRoot": 0}]}